The files in this folder are marks from the simple-icons collection
(https://github.com/simple-icons/simple-icons, package simple-icons 16.36.0),
published under CC0-1.0 (https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/), except where
the collection records another licence for a mark: index.json says which, mark by mark.
They are copied unchanged. The licence covers the files and not the brands: each mark is
the trademark of its owner, shown here to say which project a recipe installs and not to
suggest that the project made, endorses or supports the recipe or Noust.
A project whose guidelines forbid a third party's use of its logo has no file here;
its recipe carries the monogram drawn for Noust (scripts/recipe_logos.py, FORBIDDEN).
